# Dictionary data — never committed.
# data/viwiktionary-latest-pages-articles.xml.bz2 is the upstream dump;
# data/noitu.db is derived from it. Both are build artifacts produced by
# `make fetch-dict` and `make dict`. A plain .xml would be the dump
# decompressed by hand.
data/*.bz2
data/*.bz2.part
data/*.xml
data/*.db
data/*.db-journal
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm

